6. Advanced & Real-time

26. Spark Streaming vs Structured Streaming?
👉 Old Spark Streaming = DStreams (micro-batch).
👉 Structured Streaming = DataFrame/Dataset API, unified batch + streaming.

27. Checkpointing in Streaming?
👉 Saves metadata + RDDs to storage (HDFS, S3) for fault tolerance & recovery.

28. Watermarks in Structured Streaming?
👉 Allow late data by defining how long Spark waits before discarding old state.

29. Role of Kafka in Spark Streaming?
👉 Kafka is a source for real-time data ingestion into Spark Streaming.

30. Exactly-once processing in Structured Streaming?
👉 Achieved via idempotent sinks + checkpointing + transactional writes (e.g. Kafka, Delta Lake).

