7. Coding & Scenarios

31. Count unique users per day?
👉 Use groupBy(date, user).count() → then distinct().count().

32. Join two large datasets efficiently?
👉 Use broadcast() for smaller dataset or partitioned join.

33. Top 10 error messages from logs?
👉 rdd.filter(_.contains("ERROR")).map((msg,1)).reduceByKey(_+_).takeOrdered(10)(Ordering.by(-_._2)).

34. Handle out-of-memory errors?
👉 Increase executor memory, optimize partitions, persist with disk, avoid wide shuffles.

35. Debugging slow job?
👉 Check DAG in Spark UI, look for skew, optimize joins, repartition, cache where needed, use predicate pushdown.